      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 16%",
      "body": "After last week's 16% share price gain to ₹1,720, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 6x. Average forward P/E is 11x in the Oil and Gas industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 178% over the past three years. Simply Wall St's valuation model estimates the intrinsic value at ₹2,942 per share.",
